# Required Training Matrix
## Home Health Agency — Workforce Training Requirements

**Effective Date:** April 28, 2026
**Authority:** HR-TR-101 | HIPAA/HITECH | OSHA | Cal/OSHA | CMS Conditions of Participation
**Classification:** Internal — Compliance Document
**Status:** Final

---

## Overview

This matrix defines all required training lessons for each workforce role within the agency. Training completion is a condition of employment and a prerequisite for system access, patient assignment, and clinical workflow participation.

**Total Lessons:** 170
**Sections:** 16
**Governing Policy:** HR-TR-101 (Training and Competency Requirements)

